WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.230
The time for your journey has come.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.480
Go on, Yuma!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.110
You better... You better come back!

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:25.420
Yuma... You better come back here safe!

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:33.090
Just you wait for me, Astral!
 I'm gonna definitely bring you...

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.720
Wh-What the?

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.640
This...this is...

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.610
What on earth is this?!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:01:02.490
Just where is Astral world?! Can I...really get there?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.580
What's going on?!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.170
You're...!

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.340
You're the Rainbow Kuriboh my dad used! Why are you here though?

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.720
Eh? Ah...hey! Wait!

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:25.100
You...don't tell me that you're gonna guide me?

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:35.490
Thank you! I'm counting on you, Rainbow Kuriboh! Bring me to the Astral World!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.670
Indeed he has come.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.470
I...what on earth...?

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:08.100
So this is...the Astral World.

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.360
Wha...what is this?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.750
Awesome! So this is a town of the Astral World. Huh?

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:40.050
What is this? Have they wilted? This town used to be really beautiful...now this is just like some ruins.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.810
Wha...what is going on?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:02:59.820
What is happening here?!

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.030
Who...who are you?

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.540
You are Yuma Tsukumo, right?

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:11.000
Wh-Why do you know my name?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.290
You cannot visit this world!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.680
H-Hey... Wait, hold on a second! Hey! I'm not here for a fight!

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.100
Didn't I say I'm <i>not</i> your enemy?!

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.810
<i>It's just like V said...!</i>

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:39.070
<i>Even if you manage to enter the Astral World by chance, that's a completely unknown world,</i>

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.320
<i>and we have no idea what's going to happen next.</i>

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:45.160
<i>So this world won't welcome me with open arms?</i>

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.330
That hurt!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.050
Kuri-boat!

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.010
Rainbow Kuriboh?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.440
Are you serious?

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.850
Yes. There is no mistake.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:23.030
I went to those ruins many times since then and saw the sealed memories of Nasch, Merag, and I.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:30.490
Then...I slowly remembered...my memories before I became a Barian.

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:35.790
That's right. We were indeed humans in the past.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:42.460
How can that be? Then...the memories I sensed inside those ruins...!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:51.390
All of us were revived as Barians after those incidents. And if those legends from the ruins are indeed our memories, then Nasch is…

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.270
Don’t tell me...!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:58.480
I will bring back Nasch now.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.110
You saved me, Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.320
Yuma: Hey, do you know where is Astral?

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.240
H-He's here!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.580
Darn it all!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.330
Ah?! Here…here too!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.590
I'm surrounded!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.630
Shoot!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.260
Kuri-Ball!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.020
Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.520
I'm searching for Astral!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:42.570
Him again? Tch...! what a persistent guy!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.160
Kuri-smoke ball!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.730
Please... If you know the whereabouts of Astral...

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.400
Yuma...

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:27.320
D-Dad! So you really are in the Astral World, Dad!

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.320
Yuma...

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:33.580
Since it's you we're talking about, you must be sobbing tears and unable to utter a word, right?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:37.540
This is the footage I set inside Rainbow Kuriboh in advance.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.790
Dad...

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:44.750
Right now you already have no time to chat with me. Hurry up and save Astral!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.000
Huh?!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:51.470
Astral was identified as Chaos. Pretty soon he will be exterminated.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.550
Exterminated?!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:07:01.850
Rainbow Kuriboh will bring you to the whereabouts of Astral. Yuma, you are the only one who can save Astral.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.190
Dad!

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:11.490
Alright, let's get going! To save Astral!!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:41.710
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.760
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:52.220
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:55.770
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:07:55.770 --> 00:08:00.650
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:06.990
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:10.200
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.080
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:17.710
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.790
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:29.260
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:48.290
"Deity of the Holy Azure Land - Eliphas the Radiant"

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:51.340
<i>Rio, during that accident, did we really lose our lives?</i>

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:55.090
<i>But you and I are both here right now.</i>

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:05.230
<i>Why would the crest from the legend of the ruins be at our home? I just don't get it...</i>

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.860
<i>Just what on earth is going on-</i>

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:20.790
You're...! You're Durbe! Why are you here?!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.450
Ryouga...no...Nasch.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.210
It's time for your awakening!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:34.260
Go, Goblingbergh! Bring me to Astral!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.740
That hurt!

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.450
You again?! You don't give up!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:05.910
You are something which cannot exist in this world!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.830
What's that all about?!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:19.090
Stop joking! I will definitely save Astral!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.150
Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.660
What in the world is this...?

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:47.250
Over here, you are able to temporally get rid of those pursuing troops.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.420
Y-You are...?

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.500
I am Ena, a resident of Astral World.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.930
Ena, then are you the one who saved me?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:00.470
Yes.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.430
Why? Just what's going on here?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:07.140
I hope you can save everyone.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:13.560
Save them? Me? Wha...what's this?!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:19.900
All of them are the residents of this world...and they have all become sick.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:25.990
At this rate...the lights of their lives won't hold up much longer...

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:30.410
Th-This many? So, like, what do you want me to do?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.870
I want you to touch them.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:38.010
Touch them?! Huh? Don’t tell me, at that time…

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:42.720
Please. It's definitely doable with your power.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:49.480
I...I got it. Like this...?

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:00.740
What...?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:04.030
He received the power of chaos from you.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.990
The power of chaos?

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:13.670
That's right. There is no such thing as evil and hatred in this Astral World, a world of purity.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:18.880
A long time ago, chaos also existed in Astral World.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:26.260
But thousands of years ago, all souls who held chaos were exiled, thus Barian World was created.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:28.390
Then that means...

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:34.400
Right. Barian World and Astral World once used to be the same world.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.810
No way!

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:39.480
The so-called chaos is the power of desire created for oneself.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:45.280
The Astral World believes a Rank-Up can be achieved without it. Thus they abandoned chaos.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.870
But that was wrong...

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:56.170
Inside chaos contains the feelings and desire to protect someone and to live for someone from the bottom of your heart.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:58.880
Astral...

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:07.550
But this alone is the power of survival as well as the source of all original lives.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:12.930
But after losing this power, Astral World's strength was weakened.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.360
<i>Then...why can’t everyone just think of a way to solve it?</i>

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:26.820
That is impossible. Astral World is an existence that has exiled chaos to achieve Rank-Up for itself.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.160
<i>Therefore it has created Eliphas.</i>

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.280
<i>Eliphas?</i>

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:36.750
<i>The one who's pursuing you. He is the representative of this world. The one whose only goal is to Rank-Up!</i>

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.460
Wait for me, Astral!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.720
Yuma Tsukumo came here before, yes?

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:49.180
Yes, and he saved us.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.390
Using the power of chaos?

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:55.350
Yes, he gave everyone a hand.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.640
Where is he right now?

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:02.360
He is already gone. In order to save Astral, as well as save this world.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:10.740
<i>This world created Eliphas, but was also pushed to the corner due to Eliphas. Isn't there something I can do?</i>

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:14.660
<i>There is. There is only one possibility.</i>

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:15.580
<i>Possibility?</i>

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:24.710
<i>That is you and Astral. The sole possibility to save this world.</i>

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.010
Astral…

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:10.050
Astral! Astral! Hey, Astral, hey! I'm taking you home!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:15.810
Open your eyes, Astral! Astral! How long are you going to sleep?

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:20.850
Alright, let's return together! Hey, Astral!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:21.940
It's useless.

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.610
You're...!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:33.320
My name is Eliphas, the one who is pursing the ideal of this world.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:39.290
I heard everything from Ena. In other words, you're the representative of the Astral World, right?

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.040
That's right.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:43.790
Then that'll make this faster! Hurry up and release Astral!

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.630
I can't do that.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.550
Why?!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:54.260
Astral was born for the sake of eliminating Barian World and to lead this world to a higher Rank-Up.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:16:06.980
Therefore, he must always be pure and innocent. But he was tainted by your chaos! Therefore, he must be purified!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:11.030
I...tainted Astral?

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.950
So Astral... because of me?

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:20.500
Astral...I...We...

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:28.090
Astral may have changed, but...he wasn't tainted!

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:35.300
He may cry, may smile, and occasionally argue with me, but we've battled all the way together!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:40.270
No matter what the pain, no matter what the sorrow, we are always together no matter what!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:48.400
That is my...our most important bond! How can a person like you possibly understand?!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:53.110
I will definitely save Astral!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.450
You? How will you do it?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:17:02.960
In a Duel! Astral always said that a Duel itself is a sacred ritual!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.670
Then you will Duel me with Astral on the stake, yes?

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:07.330
Sure!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:13.720
Alright, then on the same time, you will put your memory with Astral on the stake.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.760
My memory along with Astral?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.090
Is that okay for you?

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.100
Fine by me, so let's do it!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.930
Then the ritual will start now!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.430
Alright!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.440
Duel Disk, set!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.780
D-Gazer, set!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.530
Duel!!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:42.620
I will go first! My turn! Draw!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:50.090
<i>That guy is the representative of this world... which means, he will definitely be as strong as Astral...</i>

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:55.050
<i>Even so, I can't lose in this Duel!</i>

00:17:55.050 --> 00:18:06.520
I activate these two Continuous Spells, Mysterious Monolith! These cards can be treated as the Xyz Materials for Rank Four Monsters!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.100
Using Magic Cards as Xyz Materials?!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:13.690
I Overlay the two Mysterious Monolitsh!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:19.280
I use these two cards to build the Overlay Network!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.530
Xyz Summon!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:30.580
Come forth, New Orders Rank 4! Etheric Anubis!

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.430
Then I set one card, and end my turn!

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:42.510
New Orders?! So that’s his Xyz!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:46.480
Here I come! My turn! Draw!

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:53.190
Rainbow Kuriboh?! I see, so you'll battle with me too?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:57.740
Alright! I Summon Ganbara Knight!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:06.080
Then I Special Summon Kagetokage!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:12.210
When a Level Four Monster was Summoned successfully, I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.960
I Overlay the Level Four Ganbara Knight and Kagetokage!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:21.430
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.220
Xyz Summon!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:29.180
Come forth, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:41.320
So it appears, huh? Aspiring Emperor - Hope. This Number is indeed the abnormality born from the irregularity of your encounter with Astral.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:53.210
Hope is no abnormality! Since my encounter with Astral, there's been no irregularity! This Hope is the utopia that Astral and I raised together!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:56.670
Then I will completely crush that utopia.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:08.520
<i>Shoot, I gotta keep my cool. That guy's Monster only has 1000 Attack Points. Summoning a Monster with such low Attack, there must be…</i>

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.430
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:15.860
<i>All you need to do is bring it to 'em like you always do.</i>

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:20.110
That's right, Astral! Here I go!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:27.950
I activate the Equip Spell, Reverse Breaker! I then equip this card 'to Hope!

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:32.580
Then I attack Anubis with Hope!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:36.880
At this moment, I activate the Equip Spell, Reverse Breaker's effect!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:43.300
When the equipped Monster attacks, it destroys one card in my opponent’s Magic/Trap Zone!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:47.890
Also, my opponent can't activate Magic or Trap Cards during this time!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.470
I destroy your set card!

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:55.350
Alright! Go, Hope! Destroy Anubis!

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.690
I activate Etheric Anubis' effect!

00:20:58.980 --> 00:20:59.690
What?!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:08.580
When a card from the Magic/Trap Zone was destroyed, by detaching one Overlay Unit, I can revive that card and activate it!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.870
I activate a Trap Card, Mysterious Mirror!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:21.000
According to its effect, my Monster will not be destroyed by battle, and the battle damage I took, you will take it instead!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:30.810
Sh...shoot! I activate Hope's effect! By detaching an Overlay Unit, it negates Hope's attack!

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:34.020
Oh? It seems you are slightly capable.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:37.600
Of course! I was taught personally how to Duel by Astral, after all!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.690
I set one card and end my turn!

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:44.030
Is that so? Taught by Astral himself, were you?

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:51.490
But you cannot win against me! I will let you witness the true Dueling of Astral World!

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:52.950
Wha...what?!

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:56.370
The Duels of the strongest Duelists are ordained by inevitability!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:59.960
Even the cards they draw are controlled by the Duelists themselves!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:02.920
No way! That light...! It can't be!

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:07.880
Shining...Draw!!

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.820
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.570
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:28.990
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:34.370
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.910
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.040
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:42.420
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.750
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:47.880
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:50.090
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:53.100
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:56.430
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.310
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:02.610
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:07.690
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:08.950
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:12.950
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:18.330
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.540
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:25.840
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.050
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:45.150
Within the Astral World, my battle to get back Astral continues!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:49.690
Eliphas continues to Rank-Up his Monsters one after another! Then he finally...!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:52.610
These are...the ruins from before...

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:54.530
<i>All of them</i> are Shining Draws?!

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:56.830
Is this my truth?!

00:23:56.830 --> 00:24:00.160
How can this be?! A Rank Twelve Xyz Monster!

00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:02.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:05.790
"A Transcendental State! The Threat of Double Rank-up!!"

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:08.670
That's...Astral!
